OL,3,ARayner announces crackdown on 'cowboy'
OL,4,Aleasehold property agents
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaseholders will be given extra
OL,7,Fprotections from "cowboy" property
OL,8,Fagents and hidden fees, Angela Rayner
OL,9,Fhas announced.
OL,11,FThe housing secretary told Labour's
OL,12,Fannual conference the government would
OL,13,Flegislate for a new independent
OL,14,Fregulator and launch a consultation to
OL,15,Fcap "rip off" administrative fees.
OL,17,FThe changes would cover the estimated
OL,18,Ffive million leaseholders in England
OL,19,Fand Wales who can be forced to pay a
OL,20,Flandlord for simple changes to their
OL,21,Fhome, despite having bought it.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
